Bernstein in conversation

00:28:35.240 --> 00:28:38.040
with professor Arturo Casadevall

00:28:38.040 --> 00:28:39.840
from the Johns Hopkins School of Medicine

00:28:39.840 --> 00:28:43.250
and he's doing groundbreaking
work on the use of plasma

00:28:43.250 --> 00:28:45.470
for the prevention and
therapy of COVID-19,

00:28:45.470 --> 00:28:47.900
I hope that you can join us then.

00:28:47.900 --> 00:28:49.990
Please visit our website cifar.ca

00:28:49.990 --> 00:28:51.740
to find out more about the series

00:28:51.740 --> 00:28:53.930
and to view our recording
from today's talk,

00:28:53.930 --> 00:28:56.350
which will be posted early next week.

00:28:56.350 --> 00:28:58.460
Thanks again to everybody for joining us

00:28:58.460 --> 00:29:00.843
